    <h2 id="w-feedback-and-status" class="text-2xl font-bold text-white mt-12 mb-6 scroll-mt-24">Feedback and status</h2>
    <p class="text-gray-400 mb-8">Small, composed pieces that tell the person what happened. Tones are role names &mdash; <code>info</code>, <code>success</code>, <code>warning</code>, <code>danger</code> &mdash; not colours.</p>
    <div class="rounded-xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.02] overflow-hidden mb-6">
        <div class="px-5 py-3 border-b border-white/5">
            <code class="text-cyan-400 text-sm font-semibold">badge(label, tone)</code>
