            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1.5">A removable tag. Omit <code>on_remove</code> for a static one.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-0">
            <div class="p-4 bg-[#171412] overflow-x-auto">
