            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1.5">The five roles a chart spends, in order and never cycled. Past the fifth there is no sixth hue to reach for — a generated one is indistinguishable from one already here to a reader with a colour vision deficiency — so the tail goes to the de-emphasis ink and the chart is expected to name it "other",</p>
