            <p class="text-gray-400 text-sm mt-1.5">A donut has no bands: an arc is not a box, and a quadrant is not an arc. Its legend is the thing under the pointer instead, and what it shows is the reading in the hole — one `set_text` for the number, one for the name, which is what a chunk is for (07 §1).</p>
